{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"artifacthub/gatekeeper-policies/k8sallowedreposv2","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:18:26.608Z","source":{"name":"Artifact Hub","api":"https://artifacthub.io/api/v1/packages/gatekeeper/gatekeeper-policies/k8sallowedreposv2","page":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/gatekeeper/gatekeeper-policies/k8sallowedreposv2"},"readme":"# Allowed Images\nThis policy enforces that container images must begin with a string from a specified list. The updated version, K8sAllowedReposv2, introduces support for exact match and glob-like syntax to enhance security: 1. Exact Match: By default, if the * character is not specified, the policy strictly checks for an exact match of the full registry, repository, and/or the image name. 2. Glob-like Syntax: Adding * at the end of a prefix allows prefix-based matching (e.g., registry.example.com/project/*). Only the * wildcard at the end of a string is supported. 3. Security Note: To avoid bypasses scenarios, ensure prefixes include a trailing / where appropriate (e.g., registry.example.com/project/*).","readmeBase":"https://open-policy-agent.github.io/gatekeeper-library/website/allowedreposv2","publisher":{"name":"Gatekeeper","url":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/search?org=gatekeeper","official":false,"verified":true,"cncf":false},"registered":null,"updated":"2024-12-17T13:21:26.000Z","categories":["Security"],"keywords":["gatekeeper","open-policy-agent","policies"],"license":"Apache-2.0","links":[{"name":"home","url":"https://open-policy-agent.github.io/gatekeeper-library/website/allowedreposv2"},{"name":"Gatekeeper repository","url":"https://github.com/open-policy-agent/gatekeeper-library/artifacthub/"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"stars":0,"subscriptions":0},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"1.0.0","digest":"sha256:f0cc8c9d1d326a9a23ae7a5c6e8a9c0b909e9fd1fab95fb5822519514e07a717","pushed":"2024-12-17T13:21:26.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":nu